{
    "background_story": "Harlee was a beautiful Buff Orpington hen, known for her stunning golden feathers and gentle disposition. She lived on a small farm with her flock, where she spent her days pecking at the earth and chasing after bugs. Harlee was a bit of a mother hen, always looking out for her fellow hens and making sure they were safe and happy. She was particularly devoted to her owner, Emily, who would often sit with her in the yard and collect eggs from the nesting box. Harlee loved nothing more than to follow Emily around the farm, clucking softly as she went about her daily chores. Despite her calm nature, Harlee had a hidden talent - she was a prolific egg-layer, producing the most beautiful brown eggs that Emily would proudly display at the local farmer's market.",
